report_text = "Divine Biology Department

EbinFlow: Did you guys get the news about our new project?
The rebirth project right?
DivineIchor: Yeah, it's like extremely messed up
Honestly I don't know if I can continue working here
I really don't feel comfortable lying to expectant moms
EbinFlow: You got to man, the pay and insurance is top tier
EbinFlow: Besides, maybe the angel parts won't cause any mutations?
